@page "/"

<PageTitle>Veilborne Web</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Veilborne Web</p>
        <h1>Browser host scaffolded for the KNI runtime.</h1>
        <p class="body">
            This project now builds as a WebAssembly app, references the shared core project,
            and publishes the shared asset tree into browser static content.
        </p>
        <p class="body">
            The desktop renderer stack still depends on native desktop APIs, so this web host is
            currently the delivery shell and canvas mount point for the browser port.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stage">
        <div class="status">KNI host target</div>
        <canvas id="veilborne-game-canvas" width="1280" height="720" aria-label="Veilborne game canvas"></canvas>
    </div>
</section>
